@format 1
@id queue.create-audio-work
@title Create active audio work
@area UI workflow
@entry input
@summary Create one audio job from the active unlocked source and current processing plan, preserving its batch identity and locking it after acceptance.
@section I. UI
@tabs Audio
@flow TB
@related queue.create-saved-audio-work, audio.save-plan, processing.source-output-collision

@alias ui = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LAudio
@alias audio = Cadroue.Application.LAudio
@alias courier = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.LCourier

[input] Audio tab requests work <input>
- Receive the active unlocked source, its relay batch, current audio plan, output preset, and relay routing @ ui.LAudioDescribe(...)
> build

[build] Build audio item <decision>
- Convert the preset, validate the source and plan, and create one audio item using the supplied source batch when present @ audio.LAudioItemCreate(...)
? "The source or plan cannot produce work" > rejected
? "An audio item is created" > persist

[persist] Add durable work <storage>
- Add the item with source-tab and relay lineage, then lock its source only when persistence accepts it @ courier.LCourierScheduleAdd(...)
- Record the queue result @ ui.LAudioDescribe(...)
> result

[result] Audio work queued <output>
= The current audio plan appears as pending work, and its source is locked against resubmission or plan edits.

[rejected] Nothing queued <error>
= No audio work record is added.
